## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Template-literal backtick in Polina prompt** — `` `state` `` inside the backtick-delimited
  prompt closed the literal → tsc TS1005. Fixed: removed backticks.
- **Killing job ROWS to stop the video storm** — did NOT immediately stop it; the storm is
  event-driven via Inngest (critic-chain VANIM↔VPREV re-fire). Row-kills reduced active
  72→0 but in-flight Inngest runs kept draining (SH17/SH26 events trickled). Definitive stop
  needs an Inngest run-cancel or a code cap — NOT job-row updates.
- **Inline `tsx -e` (multiline/import)** — still flaky; used .ts files. `/tmp/*.ts` can't
  resolve node_modules — put scripts in `webapp/scripts/`.
- **My superficial first read of «ref artist not started»** — Director corrected: it was
  UI-collapse (per-shot designers hidden), not a backend bug. Verify visually before claiming.

