## Decisions Made

- **Hide per-shot Designer/Critic from rail, keep episode-level critics** — per-shot ones fan
  out per shot (no single line makes sense); live in shot kebab. Extended Director's Reference
  instruction to the Video pair by same logic.
- **Polina prompt reads BOTH getStateMatrix + getEpisode** — matrix is shot-centric (no
  pre-production; state-matrix.ts «absent until Фаза 1b»), getEpisode carries stage-level.
- **Stop video by killing video-agent jobs only** (not clear-zombie-jobs.ts which is
  system-wide RUNNING) — to protect ref generation.

