## Environment & Setup Notes

- E31 id: `c3934ee2-c135-43e9-9a56-58b6bdc1f98b`. Stack per CLAUDE.md §13.
- Kill stuck video jobs: query `jobs` where status RUNNING/QUEUED + agent_id in
  (EXEC-VANIM,EXEC-VPREV,EXEC-VGEN), update status='FAILED' (UPPERCASE). Do NOT use
  clear-zombie-jobs.ts during a live ref run (it kills ALL RUNNING system-wide).
- Fire Inngest events: POST http://localhost:8288/e/<INNGEST_EVENT_KEY> JSON {name,data}.
- generation_config.video (E31): 480p, seedance-fal-img2vid, 9:16, standard. No parallel/seq field.
- New backlog this session: backlog_video_flow_broken_parallel_churn, backlog_critic_approval_advances_without_artifact,
  backlog_critic_revise_action_ux_gap, backlog_polina_read_tools_gap, backlog_episode_media_drive_backup.
